  "summary_md": "**Luke Parker ([@LukeParkerDev](https://x.com/LukeParkerDev/status/2115983633022644727))** rounds up community GUI plugins for **OpenCode Desktop**, including a GitHub panel with commit graph, PRs and CI, inline PR review with \"review with agent\", a per-chat notepad the agent can edit, Codex-style side chats, a plugin store and toggles, offline voice prompts with a local model, and a starter for creating plugins ([neriousy/opencode-github-panel](https://github.com/neriousy/opencode-github-panel), [create-opencode-desktop-plugin](https://github.com/spinualexandru/create-opencode-desktop-plugin)).",
